{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.X5Z5Automorphism","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.X5Z5Automorphism","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Circle"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5Z5.z5_automorphism","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5Z5.z5_automorphism","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism.lean#L47-L58","doc":"**ℤ₅ automorphism of 𝒳₅**: the map (x, y) ↦ (ζ₅·x, y) preserves\nthe defining equation y² = x⁵ - 1.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:x5-z5-automorphism}`\nRef: [bolza1887] https://doi.org/10.2307/2369402 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5Z5.zeta5_pow_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5Z5.zeta5_pow_five","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism.lean#L34-L45","doc":"ζ₅ raised to the fifth power is 1.\n`zeta5^5 = (exp(2πi/5))^5 = exp(5 · 2πi/5) = exp(2πi) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5Z5.HyperellipticQuintic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5Z5.HyperellipticQuintic","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism.lean#L29-L32","doc":"Defining predicate for 𝒳₅ : y² = x⁵ - 1 (local copy). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5Z5.zeta5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5Z5.zeta5","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism.lean#L24-L27","doc":"Primitive fifth root of unity (local copy). ","signatureChunk":0}]}